    "body": "The complete-episode Prefix fit retained a fixed Generate/U terminal competition. This adds fresh coefficient-only credit to shared Generate unary tables across the same 15 conditional positions, with 17 references and 380 original correct-prefix guards. One frozen 960-coordinate pass considers all 13,440 legal alternative codes and commits the lowest feasible native loss at each incumbent epoch. The serving implementation is unchanged.\n\nThe candidate lowers combined CE from 5.1115207302 to 3.6116773842 and improves conditional winners from 5/15 to 6/15, fixing conditional EOS. It remains negative and unselected because the complete episode fails. Actual-nine whole-answer/EOS qualification is NOT_RUN. The original selected checkpoint remains selected. This is a bounded conditional result, without a new generated reply, language, transfer, geometry-advantage or energy claim.\n\nArtifact-only completion authenticates the sealed completed learning state, repairs frozen sidecar serialization/copy boundaries, and finishes 391 finite checks and 391 actual native reloads. It performs zero new gradients, rankings or proposals; the inherited 31 backwards, 13,440 alternatives and 320 accepted coordinates are preserved unchanged. Setup/export and reader schema failures remain retained and charged separately. A prospective joint Prefix/Generate question starts from the original selected seed after delivery; it does not combine two negative checkpoints.\n\nValidation at exact final head 23e9fcd2fcfe2c40da4b6daf728cf8bfda1f58a2:\n\n- 104 focused Rust example tests, four-file rustfmt, claim wording, diff check and optimized CUDA-feature build PASS. Compile 70.329s; build 23.675s. Log SHA256 209eb3a0d01e581a05640cea2693f68b34294acd9f6d4ec8ac7620164e93126b. Unchanged CUDA coefficient parity reuses its actual bf09 PASS; 822 other library tests are NOT_RUN.\n- Independent saved arithmetic PASS: all 960 coordinates / 13,440 same-epoch alternatives / 320 commits / 1,401,440 row patches / 391 complete factor and pool snapshots. Reader 208.355s; supervisor 210.542s; peak RSS 1,178,264KiB. This does not replicate backwards, encoders or autoregressive inference.\n- Complete normative Rust verification PASS for producer, observations, audit and all 17 referenced inventories. Mathematical and adversarial source/result reviews are retained; owner-permitted exact-head self-review PASS.\n- Complete evidence private revision 4e6c74ffabd91b3d7fca58bdc388ebc318f065bd and final cold-source/checks revision 6cc7e16a99cf9912c51a1bf6dd88f57fed272ce6 passed forced-fresh per-file verification. The final source archive verified every tracked Git blob. Final-head validation binary a551eb67 is distinct from preserved measured completion binary 50a4eb5b; numeric Rust source blobs are identical.\n\nExact public receipts and scope: docs/evidence/native-generate-episode-learning-2026-10-09.json and docs/integration/current-state.md. Complete elapsed preparation, model, repair, audit, preservation and delivery cost runs continuously from the preceding actual merge at 05:15:02 UTC; final merge and fresh-main tree/blob receipt will be posted before delivery is reported. The five compatibility statuses acknowledge transport and are not test results.\n\nReferences #820",
